<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Wednesday's wool sale at Napier was 466 NZ cents per kg clean, down from 472 cents a week earlier, Wools of New Zealand said.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean) were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - n/a vs 805</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 501 vs 505</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 430 vs 437</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - n/a</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
